# Copy this file to client/.env and fill in the value.
#
# REPLACE ME: your LaunchDarkly *client-side ID* (NOT the SDK key).
# Find it in the LaunchDarkly app under:
#   Organization settings (gear icon) > Projects > <your project> > Environments > "Client-side ID"
# It is specific to one project + environment. Client-side IDs are not secret
# (they ship to the browser), but they only expose flags that have
# "Available on client-side SDKs" enabled.
VITE_LD_CLIENT_SIDE_ID=
